                                                          testsupport/naive
                                                          benchmark comparator)
  github.com/google/go-cmp       v0.7.0    BSD-3-Clause   tests only        W0.2b
  golang.org/x/net               v0.59.0   BSD-3-Clause   tests only        W0.2b
                                                          (internal/testsupport)
  golang.org/x/text              v0.42.0   BSD-3-Clause   tests only        W0.2b
                                                          (indirect, through
                                                          x/net/idna)

The versions were the newest releases on 2026-09-25 15:13:13 JST
(go list -m <module>@latest); go.mod is the record of the versions in use.

